Vintage illustration style: A 1990s corporate training room scene viewed from above, showing a large oval table surrounded by diverse office workers in period-appropriate business casual attire. Each person sits before a chunky beige CRT computer monitor displaying colorful document icons. Scattered across the polished table are small paper sheets with seemingly random letters visible. In the center, crescent-shaped pastries rest on a platter. The participants lean toward each other with animated expressions, some pointing at screens, others gesturing excitedly, creating visible invisible threads of connection between them. Warm fluorescent lighting casts a nostalgic golden glow. The color palette features muted teals, warm oranges, and cream tones typical of early 90s design. Small visual arrows or flowing ribbons weave between the workers, suggesting the flow of ideas and messages, converging toward the center in a collaborative spiral pattern.
